{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0142_1005_p", "source_sha256": "53705bf437283b2a833c9ec7f2290fcf0bded0441b35d73e93a23fe0c7adf17a", "ja": "は、早い……！", "zh": "好、好快……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0142_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "c59bae9f9f90b7223500f59e3c6babb90d721e26662bb70bc52474dc83b1d635", "ja": "この調子で、全部見つけるヨ～！\n次のボールはー、どこかナー？", "zh": "照这样下去，就能把所有球都找出来啦～！\n下一个球——会在哪里呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0142_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "c0152a67f5dad539bf4058b59ddaec316deb942cf9f6c7ee5d8860a85a1bad4f", "ja": "なんだか宝探しみたいで楽しいネ♪　……そうだ！\nどっちがたくさんボールを見つけるか、競争しようよ♪", "zh": "感觉像是在寻宝，好开心呀♪……对了！比比看谁能找到更多球吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
